text = "[font_size=18][b]Team Set-up:[/b][/font_size]
Preferably make teams of 2.
Individual or teams of 3 is also possible.
Each team chooses 2 pawns of the same color.

Pawns should not be placed on board yet!

[font_size=18][b]Multiple Pawns:[/b][/font_size]

Due to events in the game, you can have multiple pawns in play.

If you have multiple pawns in play, then after rolling
the dice you get to choose which pawn you move forward with.

[font_size=18][b]Interrupt:[/b][/font_size]

When the interrupt alarm goes off (hourglass is
empty), the person whose turn it is must perform the
interrupt task.

This task is determined by rolling the dice. See the
interrupt tasks below."

